# ============================================================
#  xcnote .gitattributes
#  统一换行符，避免"两台机器一同步就整文件 diff"
# ============================================================

# 仓库里一律存 LF；检出到工作区时按下面各条规则决定
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须是 CRLF：
# .cmd/.bat 用 LF 换行时 goto/label 会出问题，PowerShell 也是 CRLF 更稳
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不要做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary

# 下面这些即使被当成二进制也无所谓，但显式声明更清楚
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
